# Ansible Apache Deployment Project

## Overview
This project automates Apache installation and website deployment using Ansible.

## Technologies
- AWS EC2
- Ansible
- Linux
- Apache
- Git
- GitHub

## Tasks Performed
- Install Apache
- Start Apache Service
- Install Git
- Clone Website Code from GitHub
- Deploy Website to /var/www/html

## Run Playbook

```bash
ansible-playbook project.yml
